{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/5197951abdfa67bbe77f1e9fb55707fe.poster.avif?t=1765024704\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/5197951abdfa67bbe77f1e9fb55707fe.webm?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/5197951abdfa67bbe77f1e9fb55707fe.mp4?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cScreaming In The Basement\u201d\u00a0</i></strong>is a first-person psychological horror game, delving into an evil rooted beyond<strong> </strong>darkness, a realistic and immersive horror atmosphere. an investigative reporter called Mike investigates a tragic family murder. Strange things from 1991 occur. This game is inspired by P.T.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f62f8cd2256a850e23c5bc82a399b8ee.poster.avif?t=1765024704\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f62f8cd2256a850e23c5bc82a399b8ee.webm?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f62f8cd2256a850e23c5bc82a399b8ee.mp4?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>WARNING:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights, rapid visual effects, and intense imagery that may trigger seizures or other adverse reactions in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy or similar conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/34747ee8bcfef3e34e458e0288d332f6.poster.avif?t=1765024704\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/34747ee8bcfef3e34e458e0288d332f6.webm?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/34747ee8bcfef3e34e458e0288d332f6.mp4?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR STORY BEGINS, THEIR FATE UNFOLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mike is the main character, a journalist always chasing the story behind the story. He gains access to an apartment that, according to news reports, is said to be home to restless souls, though no one\u2019s ever confirmed it, a residence tied to a terrible incident. A family consisting of a father, mother, and daughter once lived in the apartment and were killed by someone whose identity remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1990, a family bought a house in Russia from Robert. After hearing strange noises from the basement and a curse, they left and moved to New York, they rented apartment from Norman Harold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sarah often heard strange whispers and scratching sounds coming from below. Sometimes, it sounded like someone was calling her name. She tried to tell her parents, but they dismissed her fears, saying it was just the old place settling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f22979a285e607507cc6d5a328f59a61.poster.avif?t=1765024704\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f22979a285e607507cc6d5a328f59a61.webm?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f22979a285e607507cc6d5a328f59a61.mp4?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN INTENSE, IMMERSIVE JOURNEY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong><br>&quot;Walking Simulator&quot; focused on story, exploration, and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong><br>Three different endings unfold depending on the choices you make. Can you find the truth behind what\u2019s happening, or will you lose yourself to the darkness around you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong><br>Aesthetic inspired by the 1990s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lens of Reality</strong><br>You\u2019ll carry a powerful Polaroid camera that exposes the things no human eye can see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Design</strong><br>The immersive sound design pulls you deeper into the experience, building tension at every moment until you\u2019re fully surrounded by a growing sense of madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal Elements</strong><br>Paranormal activity makes objects move and causes the environment to change in strange and unexpected ways, making you feel something beyond this world is present.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice and Consequence</strong><br>Your actions, choices, and recordings determine how the story unfolds through a disturbing supernatural history.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/cf5c665a9d8a39258863cb2c355545fc.poster.avif?t=1765024704\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/cf5c665a9d8a39258863cb2c355545fc.webm?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/cf5c665a9d8a39258863cb2c355545fc.mp4?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GRIPPING CINEMATIC EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness creeps in every corner, and silence hides the screams. The intense psychological horror into madness, the game draws you into a cinematic nightmare where every moment feels like a scene from your worst horror film, and the truth you\u2019re searching for may be the very thing that destroys you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3441360?t=1765024704","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/f3adfd904d7a8090d79489e7bd740757874cb452/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765024704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/264f4e29b3eb29a5b9f87df32d7f28528d09ccad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765024704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/264f4e29b3eb29a5b9f87df32d7f28528d09ccad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765024704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence that may negatively affect the viewer\u2019s psychological state. Some content may be inappropriate for certain age groups. It is advised to apply suitable age restrictions for the intended audience."},"demos":[{"appid":3443100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/5197951abdfa67bbe77f1e9fb55707fe.poster.avif?t=1765024704\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/5197951abdfa67bbe77f1e9fb55707fe.webm?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/5197951abdfa67bbe77f1e9fb55707fe.mp4?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cScreaming In The Basement\u201d\u00a0</i></strong>is a first-person psychological horror game, delving into an evil rooted beyond<strong> </strong>darkness, a realistic and immersive horror atmosphere. an investigative reporter called Mike investigates a tragic family murder. Strange things from 1991 occur. This game is inspired by P.T.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f62f8cd2256a850e23c5bc82a399b8ee.poster.avif?t=1765024704\" width=664 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/f62f8cd2256a850e23c5bc82a399b8ee.webm?t=1765024704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source s